<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dis-rāro</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dī-rāro</span></b> , āre,
			v. a.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In econom. lang., <i>to thin out</i>, <i>to make thin</i> by cutting,
				<i><span class="en">Col.
				4, 32, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 6,
				36</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> Of nutriment, <i>to thin</i>, <i>dilute</i>, <i><span class="en">Cael.
				Aur. Acut. 1, 15, 152</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b> Of the body, <i>to
				cause to perspire excessively</i>, <i><span class="en">Cael.
				Aur. Acut. 1, 15, 133</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 11, 84</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
